Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:20.50,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Now, descendant of Romuald Blood, Mizumura Shinta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:25.50,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I ask of you to create a new life with me to give rise to the new Strigoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:54.95,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Is this a all right, Kishimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:10.96,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What should I do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.72,0:01:23.02,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Kishimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:28.15,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What have you been waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.49,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You guys sure are slow. I was bored to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:37.61,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This guy... This will be no walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:39.32,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,WYD.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:41.83,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:44.33,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:46.29,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'm a bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:49.88,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,The time for me to become useful has arrived.
