Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:13.06,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, I started to do something horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:15.94,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,There's no need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:18.32,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What happened earlier was what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:25.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Umm... I shouldn't say this after doing that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:31.00,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Kishimoto-san, you should take better care of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:34.17,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:42.47,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I guess she hates me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:51.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Damn it, this seriously sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:55.35,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,If you're this beat—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:56.81,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:59.32,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,And here I am being nice to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:02.90,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,So she had a bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:04.99,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,PLM.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:07.70,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Put your life on the line for the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:08.78,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Commander Cliff...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:10.29,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,WSC.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:15.08,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,We must be both smooth and smart when conducting our next operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.92,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,We won't fail next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:19.88,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,We will need reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:20.84,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Weapons are all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:23.30,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,He has a tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:24.22,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:30.85,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,In the tragedy of Sarashu, a certain wife gave us one hard time. {tlc}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:36.98,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Come, I'll take you all with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:43.23,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:46.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Lilith, this is farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:59.17,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Commander Cliff, are you unhurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.49,0:06:05.80,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Damn her. That crazy woman took out Captain Odin Romuald.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:14.02,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Father. Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.73,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:20.10,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Lilith, your mother had something important to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:22.86,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Mom. I want to see Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:26.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Since you're a good girl I'll give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:31.32,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This is the only thing your parents can give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:33.37,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:46.38,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Thanks to my parents protecting me, I'm now the sole survivor of the Sarashu incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:47.63,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:52.51,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I can't die until I fulfill my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.73,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:00.73,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Yuck, look at how they are kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:02.94,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,They are really into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.94,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,My boyfriend and I aren't even close to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Yuck, and you want to imitate them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:10.24,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.16,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:14.58,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I needed that snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.25,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hey, somebody has collapsed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:23.88,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:31.93,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Away we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:40.56,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Shinta...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:43.15,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,He was really serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.19,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Those eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:48.53,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Those eyes were lusting over my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Shinta's a guy after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:53.91,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,And all guys are after that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.20,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:00.62,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,K-Kamiura?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:02.04,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Woah, awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.88,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You were able to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.04,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:07.55,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:08.63,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,How did you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:11.42,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm your guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:14.64,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,And your guardian should always be by your side and embrace you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.06,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You don't need to cling, Kamuira.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:19.35,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Are you shy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:20.48,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I won't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:21.64,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:25.02,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Your waist has become a perfect complement to your figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:29.36,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Did fucking your boyfriend daily help with your figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:30.61,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It must be delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:32.49,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,As a woman, I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:36.24,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You came here just to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:37.28,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:42.66,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I wanted to see if this nice body could live up to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:45.42,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Is he rough with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.34,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:48.96,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Lighten up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:53.80,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,She surely hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:02.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Lilith. Listen, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:07.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,A bunch of guys tried to intrude but I beat them up by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:08.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'm amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:11.44,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Praise me, Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:12.49,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Praise me, prai—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:16.57,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.57,0:09:18.07,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You're as ugly as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.62,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Kamiura?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:24.37,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you doing here and when did you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:25.92,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Wait, what was I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:29.84,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to be Lilith's bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.71,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Falling asleep on the bed like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.46,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Get a grip already, ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.55,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'm doing a very good job protecting her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:37.64,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Bye, Ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:38.51,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:43.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What's up her butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:46.60,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,We've gone so long without seeing each other and that's the first thing she does?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.69,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,There you are, Plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:57.95,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:19.34,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:21.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,My inescapable destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:26.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,That mark on your chest is proof of your oath with the Moroi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:30.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Your mission is to give birth to the child of Romuald blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:32.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,then kill both father and child, and bathe in their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.82,0:10:36.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,A righteous act, all for the sake of the Strigoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:43.70,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,If you can't complete it, that mark will become your curse for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:50.50,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Kamiura, it's not that I'm scared of losing my virginity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.92,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I will show you that I can have his child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:56.01,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,My determination will not falter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:00.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I feel better after hearing those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.94,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kishimoto-san...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:16.44,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's this even when sitting next to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:19.15,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}This behavior is unforgivable.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:23.24,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's been looking at me since class started.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.83,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}She doesn't hate me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:27.04,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm glad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:33.67,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shin-chan, we both came from Kyushu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:37.67,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can't you see? You can't beat a childhood friend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:41.09,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no way I will lose to that new student.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:43.34,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}You hear that, Shin-chan?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:44.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:47.47,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's bleeding.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.35,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jeez.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:52.44,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if it's deep...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:53.69,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:56.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}The wound disappeared?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:04.95,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,TBF.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:06.37,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:09.83,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This refreshing breeze gives a calming feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.41,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:12.54,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.54,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,So, what should we do about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:17.63,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Are we seriously going to force him to awaken?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:19.21,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Commander Cliff Strife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:21.76,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,He is the descendant of the Romuald bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:24.97,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It would be good if we could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:26.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:27.97,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,We need him to deal with the Strigoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:30.89,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It would be good if he agreed to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.35,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Especially in dealing with the Moroin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:37.65,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I don't know if the people of this world can handle
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:40.86,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,all this strangeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:41.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:45.37,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,SMH,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:46.32,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.83,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What's that, Cammot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.21,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Ah, you can't play with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:56.00,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I got this from Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.34,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's a memento of my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:03.01,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It feels like there's a rock in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:04.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What's this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:07.89,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Has this always been in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:11.64,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}My chest...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}it hurts...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:17.11,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Oh, Shinta's starting to awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:20.07,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,C-Cammot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.65,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You've awoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:24.49,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It was said that you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:26.91,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Wha—C-Cammot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.91,0:13:29.16,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You are Cammot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:32.41,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Shinta, a lot of scary stuff is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.41,0:13:34.12,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:34.87,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.50,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.67,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Cammot is here with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I couldn't land properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:54.31,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Oh, Shinta. Does your chest still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:56.44,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.65,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Anyway, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:00.77,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'm Cammot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:01.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Cammo—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.65,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:05.86,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Aren't you a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:07.78,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.24,0:14:10.37,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Cammot is on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:12.54,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,But why is a cat talk—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:13.70,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:17.92,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,As long as I'm here you will be all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.00,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Shinta...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:24.71,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Be careful around that red-eyed, red-haired girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.99,0:14:27.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Huh, red?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.55,0:14:29.47,Shinta's Note 1,,0,0,0,,{\frz341.2\an8\t(0,840,\fscx98\fscy98)\move(600,595.2,604.8,576.2,0,903)}Shinta's \NHopeless Diary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.47,0:14:29.97,Shinta's Note 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\frz13.46\move(728,632,724,621,22,188)}Shinta's \NHopeless Diary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.97,0:14:30.43,Shinta's Note 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\frz359.3\move(650,721,650,700,22,189)}Shinta's \NHopeless Diary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.81,Shinta's Note 3,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\frz332.6\t(0,100,\fscx238\fscy178)\move(512,725,515.6,713.6,28,229)}Shinta's \NHopeless Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:34.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Read these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.48,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:37.44,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hopeless Shinta Diary?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:37.44,0:14:39.40,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This one is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:46.31,Shinta's Note 4,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(640,595)}Shinta's \NHopeless Diary
Dialogue: 2,0:14:39.81,0:14:42.65,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Shinta's first perverted day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:46.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,And this one is when Shinta freaked out when baby fur grew under his privates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:50.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! I didn't freak out when baby fur—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:52.24,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Eh? Baby fur?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:53.83,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:56.79,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I've always been by your side so ask me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:59.08,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:05.63,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,So you really wrote these, Cammot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:11.09,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What happened when my mother died is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.43,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,And even when Grandpa died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:15.31,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Eh, Romuald?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:19.39,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Where have I heard that word before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:21.31,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,...Romuald bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:26.69,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,717)}Kishimoto-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Those are the same words she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:37.66,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kishimoto-san, just what are you after?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.08,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Romuald bloodline.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:46.05,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've heard that before.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:48.84,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grandpa used to say those words.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:51.97,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's no use. I can't remember.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:54.85,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:01.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:03.98,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto? {fade in}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:06.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Romuald bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:13.32,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Love between a Strigoli and a hunter won't be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:16.45,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Because your blood will get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.37,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,"My blood will get in the way"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.46,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hey, Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.63,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Huh, Shin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:29.09,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:31.55,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Let's go eat lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.80,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Sorry, but not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:38.72,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Why not!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.98,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Are you not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:45.15,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I just need some time alone to think some things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:46.36,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:48.69,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Wait, Shin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:52.95,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I needed to talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:58.74,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,My body is acting a bit strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:01.29,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I cut my finger and the bleeding stopped immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:08.75,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,No matter how much it hurts, the wound disappears so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:12.51,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's almost as if I'm not human anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.80,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's weird, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:17.89,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Help me, Shin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.10,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:24.73,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Silver bullets...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:27.19,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It won't be long until all of them have been blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:30.90,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Headquarters have given us a lot of stuff with that letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:32.15,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,TCM.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:36.99,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,That just shows they want us to complete this mission by sending them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.66,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,When the Romuald descendant awakens,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:43.41,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,they want us to have an advantage in case things go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:46.17,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Once the descendant awakens {Not sure where to end line}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:49.29,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,he will probably kill the target. {Not sure where to start line}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:51.75,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,DKT.{Descendant Kill Target}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.65,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,My favorite food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:11.32,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Even better, it's in honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.23,0:18:13.86,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Tonight is going to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:23.49,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Silver chains...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:25.96,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Lilith, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:28.83,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Did I wake you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.83,0:18:32.50,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Sorry, but mind if I borrow that face of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.34,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Lilith, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.60,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,These silver chains render my powers useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:49.77,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Yes, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.32,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:56.86,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,A message from Cliff-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.58,0:19:03.83,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Such a nice view.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:05.87,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:09.79,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,rather naughty people were embarrassed publicly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:12.46,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,by the command of the governor to dunk them in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:17.80,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,As a spectator, I'm enjoying the same scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:21.64,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I don't know if you've noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:26.02,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,but these guns are loaded with silver bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:31.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,If I shot you with one of these you would be destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:33.48,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,which would prove that you are not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:37.07,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You don't want to end the Strigoli, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:38.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Start begging for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:40.78,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.82,0:19:42.95,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.95,0:19:47.92,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This gun is capable of killing you no matter how much you beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:49.29,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:52.29,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Don't talk or it might go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:53.63,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:19:59.34,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:02.59,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,but it's not my duty to pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:06.22,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,The one who will should be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:09.35,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Until then, behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:14.19,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,P-Pervert,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:17.07,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,is toying with people's lives one of your hobbies?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:19.36,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:25.78,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Cold, white skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:26.95,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:28.24,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Look at this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:33.08,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,whenever I apply pressure the nipple stands out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:36.88,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You're not that bad with a body like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.31,0:20:42.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I thought the Strigoli's white cold flesh would be hard to cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:43.51,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:45.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What should I do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:48.01,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Should I play with your belly button?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:52.14,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Or maybe you could grasp it with your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.77,0:20:55.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I wonder if you will still be cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.11,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:21:01.61,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Your body's cold from the start, and it won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:03.53,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,S-Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:04.61,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:06.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:09.99,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Have you heard of the word {\i1}casso{\i0}  before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:12.62,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It means "to cause destruction" in Latin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:16.54,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,A fitting term for the Strigoli and Moroi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:20.21,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okasu{\i0} is a similar word in Japanese which means to rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:23.09,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You'll be destroyed anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:26.89,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.72,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Is my spit a form of casso?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.13,0:21:37.15,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's a word made up by those like yourself who didn't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:39.23,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's a repetition of god's words. {tlc}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:42.61,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It means to clean up the garbage, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:44.57,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I don't care what you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:47.62,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Even if you try to break me by defiling my body, I will never—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:58.29,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:22:00.55,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Kishimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.13,0:22:06.43,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:10.81,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,We have been awaiting your arrival, Romuald descendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:12.89,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Eh? Cliff-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:15.44,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you doing in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:18.27,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Hurry! Help her right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.27,0:22:20.61,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Don't call the name of that garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.07,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.43,0:22:26.82,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,That girl isn't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.82,0:22:29.07,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You're worrying about a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.07,0:22:30.28,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:32.99,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's your duty to eliminate such a being.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:37.42,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Please use this sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:38.42,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.21,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,"Eliminate"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:42.75,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you saying? I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:45.51,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,LKO.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:50.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,You shall learn how we keep social order in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:53.06,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What is this LK you are talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:54.27,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,All of this—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.27,0:22:55.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:22:57.31,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'll help you with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:02.19,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,So, descendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.77,0:23:05.28,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Lets do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:06.65,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.65,0:23:09.03,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,If Kishimotos-san gets hit she'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.03,0:23:10.87,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Of course she will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.87,0:23:12.41,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.41,0:23:15.45,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Let me teach you how adults do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.91,0:23:19.46,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,No, this is different from normal adults, sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:21.42,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:22.79,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Please let me go, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.79,0:23:23.71,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.01,0:23:26.71,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's all right. She isn't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.71,0:23:33.43,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This silver sword can conveniently kill her in one hit and leave no trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.01,0:23:37.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,No, Cliff-sensei. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.18,0:23:39.48,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Please stop. We shouldn't be doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:41.77,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I don't want to kill someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:43.52,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Yes, we must.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.52,0:23:45.02,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,For the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:53.95,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,He's awoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:04.17,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.17,0:24:06.88,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Stop it. He's the descendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.95,0:24:09.01,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Let's leave for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.01,0:24:10.01,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:11.51,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's just as the legend says...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.97,0:24:13.43,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,RQP.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:16.18,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Retreat as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:17.02,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.89,0:24:21.31,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This means you've become an adult, descendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.94,0:24:23.98,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,This is all for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.98,0:24:25.44,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:26.19,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Good bye. {fades}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.44,0:24:44.75,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.75,0:24:47.84,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,It's all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.35,0:24:58.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Kishimoto-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:25:00.68,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,it's good you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.81,0:25:02.98,Subtitles (Default),,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.05,0:25:35.55,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}My days just keep on repeating
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.55,0:25:38.30,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}An echo that makes my head hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.30,0:25:44.06,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}Ah, these fragile feelings I've been hiding
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:47.10,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}That you will reveal in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.10,0:25:50.23,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}Come on, just a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.23,0:25:54.53,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}Nobody understands, nobody knows
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.53,0:25:55.82,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}And yet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.82,0:26:01.95,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}Your delicate feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.99,0:26:04.96,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}And sharp anxiety
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.96,0:26:07.88,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}Are starting to pierce through me
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:13.67,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}The feelings we screamed out are so far away
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:19.60,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}I know we'll manage to overcome fate
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.60,0:26:24.89,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}So that the reality we painted doesn't smear
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.93,0:26:32.15,END eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}Bite those lips and don't let go
