Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.30,0:25:44.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}aa kowaresou da boku no kakushita ura no kanjou
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:47.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}mirai ni dare ga furerareru no
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.10,0:25:50.23,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}sukoshi kurai wa ii jan ka
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.23,0:25:54.53,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}dare ni mo wakaranai nobody knows
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.53,0:25:55.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}soredemo
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.82,0:26:01.95,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}kimi no sensai na omoi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.99,0:26:04.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}eiri na fuan wa mou
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.96,0:26:07.88,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}boku ni tsukisashite
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:13.67,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}futari no koe sakenda omoi wa zutto tooku
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:19.60,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}unmei mo kitto koerareru darou
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.60,0:26:24.89,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}irozuita ima nijimanai you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.93,0:26:32.15,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(50,100)}sono kuchibiru ni ha wo tatete hanasanai
